{"translation":"A Farewell to Envoy Yuan on His Mission to Anxi

By Wang Wei

Morning rain in Weicheng settles the light dust;
The inn is green, the willows fresh.
I urge you to drink one more cup of wine—
West of Yang Pass, there will be no old friends."}

