{"translation":"Bidding Farewell to Meng Haoran at Yellow Crane Tower

My old friend bids farewell to the west, leaving Yellow Crane Tower,
Amid the mist and blossoms of March, he sails down to Yangzhou.
His lone sail, a distant shadow, vanishes in the blue expanse;
I see only the Yangtze, flowing toward the sky's edge."}

