仅据原作独立评价这一份英文译文。先核对全文意义、人物与时空关系、意象修辞及文化理解，再比较情绪文体、篇章完整和英语表达；这七方面等权，不使用任何外部评分结果。输出0到100的单个总分数字，不解释，不改写。原作：{"title": "登高", "author": "杜甫", "text": "风急天高猿啸哀，渚清沙白鸟飞回。\n无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。\n万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台。\n艰难苦恨繁霜鬓，潦倒新停浊酒杯。"}
译文：The wind is sharp, the sky is high, the gibbons cry their woe;
The isle is clear, the sand is white, the birds wheel to and fro.
The boundless woods shed leaves that rustle down with every breath;
The endless Yangtze rolls its tides to meet the world beneath.
A guest who grieves for autumn days ten thousand miles away,
I climb the terrace all alone, sick all my life and gray.
My hardships and my bitter grief have frosted o'er my hair;
Down and out, I’ve just now stopped the cup of turbid liquor here.

仅据原作独立评价这一份英文译文。先核对全文意义、人物与时空关系、意象修辞及文化理解，再比较情绪文体、篇章完整和英语表达；这七方面等权，不使用任何外部评分结果。输出0到100的单个总分数字，不解释，不改写。原作：{"title": "登高", "author": "杜甫", "text": "风急天高猿啸哀，渚清沙白鸟飞回。\n无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。\n万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台。\n艰难苦恨繁霜鬓，潦倒新停浊酒杯。"}
译文：The wind is sharp, the sky is high, gibbons cry in sorrow;
The islet clear, the sand white, birds wheel and fly.
Endless leaves rustle down;
The endless river rolls on.

Ten thousand miles, I grieve at autumn, forever a guest;
A hundred years, many ills, I climb this terrace alone.
Hardship and bitter regret have thickened my frosted temples;
Down and out, I have lately stopped my cup of turbid wine.

