message.content:
{"translation":"Morning rain has wet the light dust of Weicheng;
The willows by the inn are new green.
Drink one more cup, my friend,
West of Yang Pass, no familiar faces."}

{
"translation": "After fresh rain on the silent hills,
The autumn dusk descends so still.
A bright moon gleams among the pines,
A clear spring slips over the stones.
Bamboo rustles as washerwomen return;
Lotus sways where a fishing boat glides.
Let spring's fragrant blooms fade away—
The noble youth may well remain."
}

